  "description": "Agent Sync — a Git-native consistency manager for AI-agent skills and instructions. Define a canonical skill once under .agent/ and project it into AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, Cursor rules, GitHub Copilot, Gemini, and OpenAI/Claude skill folders, with drift detection and Git-hook/CI enforcement. Installs the `agent` command (also usable as `git agent` with the AgentSync.Git package).",
